        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048172",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Risk Factors—Risks Related to Our Business and Industry—If we fail to offer high-quality products to consumers, our business, reputation, results of operations and financial condition will be materially and adversely affected” and also “—Should a product liability issue, recall or personal injury issue arise, it may damage our reputation and brand image, which may result in a material adverse effect on our business, reputation, results of operations and financial condition.”",
